    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></i></p><p>Standard on the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/YVH_Battle_Droid\" title=\"YVH Battle Droid\">YVH Battle Droid</a>, a YV Sensor Package can be successfully installed on other Droids, including Mouse Droids (see <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/MSE-6_Repair_Droid\" title=\"MSE-6 Repair Droid\">MSE-6 Repair Droid</a>). The YV Sensor Package features highly specialized sensors calibrated specifically to detect <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong\" title=\"Yuuzhan Vong\">Yuuzhan Vong</a>, including those concealed by <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ooglith_Masquer\" title=\"Ooglith Masquer\">Ooglith Masquers</a> or other methods. The YV Sensor Package grants a +10 bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> checks to detect <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong\" title=\"Yuuzhan Vong\">Yuuzhan Vong</a> within 12 squares and with in line of sight of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a>.</p>",
    "source": "Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids",
